外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,57.2 9.1,52.8 14.2,53.4 19.3,61.9 24.5,65.9 29.6,60.5 34.7,65.4 39.8,57.9 44.9,49.1 50.0,53.3 55.1,59.1 60.3,73.4 65.4,74.7 70.5,66.7 75.6,62.4 80.7,68.7 85.8,79.1 91.0,88.5 96.1,85.0 101.2,86.5 106.3,89.9 111.4,90.8 116.5,84.7 121.6,87.0 126.8,85.5 131.9,51.5 137.0,41.9 142.1,16.2 147.2,20.3 152.3,39.2 157.4,33.7 162.6,61.7 167.7,58.9 172.8,65.4 177.9,59.0 183.0,67.9 188.1,66.2 193.2,46.3 198.4,62.0 203.5,54.7 208.6,55.2 213.7,67.1 218.8,37.2 223.9,42.8 229.0,33.7 234.2,38.1 239.3,38.9 244.4,39.3 249.5,21.2 254.6,24.3 259.7,12.8 264.9,22.8 270.0,19.6 275.1,20.3 280.2,27.2 285.3,53.5 290.4,55.8 295.5,74.4 300.7,72.7 305.8,83.3 310.9,97.2 316.0,86.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"86.3\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 6.1,95.1 8.3,93.1 10.4,94.6 12.5,94.3 14.7,92.6 16.8,88.7 19.0,87.3 21.1,86.5 23.2,88.4 25.4,86.2 27.5,82.7 29.6,78.6 31.8,75.4 33.9,76.0 36.1,80.9 38.2,76.4 40.3,76.2 42.5,79.0 44.6,72.2 46.7,78.0 48.9,75.1 51.0,76.3 53.2,72.0 55.3,69.4 57.4,73.0 59.6,73.3 61.7,71.4 